## AUTHENTICATION DEPENDENCIES

```python
# Usage in routers:
# Public endpoint — no auth needed
@router.get("/products")
async def list_products(tenant = Depends(get_tenant)):
    ...

# Any logged-in user
@router.get("/orders/mine")
async def my_orders(user = Depends(get_current_user), tenant = Depends(get_tenant)):
    ...

# Admin only
@router.post("/products")
async def create_product(
    user = Depends(require_role(["shop_admin", "manager"])),
    tenant = Depends(get_tenant)
):
    ...

# SaaS admin only (no tenant context)
@router.get("/tenants")
async def list_tenants(saas_user = Depends(saas_admin_required)):
    ...
```

